/* Yahoo! KeyKey legacy import */
"Legacy Data:" = "舊版資料：";
"Import Yahoo! KeyKey Data…" = "匯入 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法資料…";
"No legacy data found." = "找不到舊版資料";
"ChiaKey could not find a Yahoo! KeyKey user database in ~/Library/Application Support/Yahoo! KeyKey." = "在 ~/Library/Application Support/Yahoo! KeyKey 裡找不到 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法的使用者詞庫。";
"Yahoo! KeyKey is not installed." = "Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法沒有安裝";
"Its user phrase database is encrypted and only that input method can read it, so only %lu plain-text file(s) were imported. Reinstall Yahoo! KeyKey and try again to bring the phrases over." = "它的使用者詞庫是加密的，只有那套輸入法本身讀得開，因此這次只匯入了 %lu 個純文字檔。若要一併帶回自訂詞，請重新安裝 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法後再試一次。";
"Could not read the legacy database." = "無法讀取舊版詞庫";
"ChiaKey asked Yahoo! KeyKey to export its phrases, but it did not answer. Switch to Yahoo! KeyKey, type a character to wake it up, then try again. On Apple Silicon this also needs Rosetta 2, because Yahoo! KeyKey has no Apple Silicon version." = "熊熊注音已經請 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法匯出自訂詞，但它沒有回應。請先切換到 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法隨便打一個字把它喚醒，再回來試一次。在 Apple Silicon 上還需要安裝 Rosetta 2，因為 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法沒有 Apple Silicon 版本。";
"Imported %lu phrase(s) and %lu other file(s) from Yahoo! KeyKey." = "已從 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法匯入 %lu 個自訂詞與 %lu 個其他檔案。";
"BearSpark doesn't publish app updates yet." = "熊熊注音目前尚未提供程式更新。";

/* Preferences pane notes */
"Only needed for a non-US keyboard, or to type with Hanyu Pinyin and the like." = "用非美式鍵盤，或用漢語拼音等方式輸入時才需要調整。";
"Candidates in one row across, or one column down; Down (across) or Right (down) opens the full list." = "候選字橫向排成一列，或直向排成一欄；橫向按 ↓、直向按 → 可以展開完整清單。";
"Cycles through the input methods built into BearSpark, such as Smart Phonetic and Cangjie." = "在熊熊注音內建的輸入法（好打注音、倉頡等）之間輪流切換。";
"Tap Shift on its own to type English without switching input methods." = "單獨輕點一下 Shift，不用切換輸入法就能打英文。";
"macOS normally wants Caps Lock held a moment; with this on, a quick press is enough." = "macOS 預設要按住 Caps Lock 一下才會切換；開啟後輕按就切換。";
"Beeps when the keys typed do not make a syllable." = "打出的按鍵拼不成注音時，用聲音提醒。";
"A system sound, or a sound file of your own." = "選一個系統音效，或使用自己的音效檔。";
"Unchecked input methods stay out of the input menu." = "取消勾選的輸入法不會出現在輸入選單裡。";
"BearSpark Preferences" = "熊熊注音 偏好設定";
"How the Bopomofo symbols are laid out on the keyboard." = "注音符號在鍵盤上的排列方式。";
"Esc clears all the text not yet sent, not just the symbols being typed." = "按 Esc 清掉所有還沒送出的文字，而不只是正在打的注音。";
"With text in the composing area, Space opens the candidate window." = "組字區有字時，按空白鍵叫出選字窗。";
"Whether the cursor sits before or after the characters you are choosing for." = "選字時，游標停在要換的字前面還是後面。";
"The keys that pick candidates in the candidate window." = "選字窗裡用來選字的按鍵。";
"How many characters the composing area holds; beyond that the first ones are sent." = "組字區最多放幾個字，超過時最前面的字會自動送出。";
"Letters typed with Shift come out in upper case; off, in lower case." = "按住 Shift 打字母時輸出大寫；關掉則輸出小寫。";
"Type English words and numbers without switching input methods." = "英文單字和數字可以直接打，不用切換輸入法。";
"The candidate window also lists matching emoji." = "選字窗裡也列出相關的 emoji。";
"Also offer the rare characters in the CNS 11643 set." = "候選字也列出全字庫（CNS 11643）收錄的罕用字。";
"Sends the character once all its radicals are typed, without Space." = "字根打滿時直接送出，不用再按空白鍵。";
"Characters you use often move up the candidate list." = "常用的字會慢慢排到選字窗前面。";
"Radicals that make no character are cleared away." = "字根組不出字時，自動清掉已打的字根。";
"Candidates show up as you type each radical." = "邊打字根邊顯示候選字。";
"Full-width or half-width punctuation." = "標點符號用全形或半形。";
"Add and change the words you use." = "新增、修改自己常用的詞。";
"Back your own words up to a file, or bring a backup back." = "把自訂詞備份成檔案，或從備份還原。";
"Brings over the words you added in Yahoo! KeyKey." = "把在 Yahoo! 奇摩輸入法加過的自訂詞帶過來。";
"Removes BearSpark from this Mac." = "從這台 Mac 移除熊熊注音。";
